      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I did figure out a workaround in the meantime, using a single PhysBone set to Polar and using curves to limit the 2nd bone to a hinge type of rotation. This doesn't change the fact however that converted DB to PB will break if it results in a PB being a direct child of another PB",
